oc":"The year of the proleptic Gregorian calendar, 1 to 9999.","name":"year","type":"int"},{"doc":"The month, 1 (January) to 12 (December).","name":"month","type":"int"},{"doc":"The day of the month, 1 to the number of days of that month in that year.","name":"day","type":"int"},{"doc":"The hour on the wall clock, 0 to 23.","name":"hour","type":"int"},{"doc":"The minute, 0 to 59.","name":"minute","type":"int"},{"doc":"The second, 0 to 59; a leap second is not written as 60.","name":"second","type":"int"},{"doc":"The millisecond, 0 to 999.","name":"millisecond","type":"int"},{"default":null,"doc":"The name of the time zone in the IANA time zone database, such as Europe/Berlin. Null for a floating time; then offset_seconds and instant_ms are null as well.","name":"zone","type":["null","string"]},{"default":null,"doc":"The offset of the wall clock from UTC, in seconds, -64800 to 64800, as the writer's rules of the zone gave it at the instant, such as 3600 for 01:00 east of UTC. Null for a floating time, and only then.","name":"offset_seconds","type":["null","int"]},{"default":null,"doc":"The instant, in milliseconds since 1970-01-01T00:00:00Z without leap seconds: the wall clock read as if it were UTC, minus offset_seconds. Null for a floating time, and only then.","name":"instant_ms","type":["null","long"]}],"name":"DateTime","namespace":"axt","type":"record"}]},{"axt.emoji":"⏹️","axt.help":"When the link ends.","axt.help_translations":{"de":"Wann die Verknüpfung endet."},"axt.label":"Until","axt.label_translations":{"de":"Bis"},"default":null,"doc":"The first moment after the link, as for the end of an appointment. Null when it has no end or it is not known.","name":"end","type":["null","axt.DateTime"]},{"axt.advanced":true,"axt.emoji":"🗂️","axt.help":"Further details of the link.","axt.help_translations":{"de":"Weitere Angaben zur Verknüpfung."},"axt.label":"Details","axt.label_translations":{"de":"Details"},"default":{},"doc":"Further values that the kind of the relation needs, by names its kind gives them. Empty when there are none.","name":"attributes","type":{"type":"map","values":"string"}}],"name":"Relation","namespace":"axt","type":"record"},"type":"array"}},{"default":[],"doc":"The extensions of the record: records of the apps' own types that add fields of their own to it (spec/fields.md, section 12), at most one of each type. Empty when it has none.","name":"extensions","type":{"items":{"axt.emoji":"🧩","axt.help":"Further fields that an app adds to this entry.","axt.help_translations":{"de":"Weitere Felder, die eine App diesem Eintrag hinzufügt."},"axt.label":"Extension","axt.label_translations":{"de":"Erweiterung"},"doc":"An extension: one record of an app's own type that the app adds to a record of another type, such as the fields of its own that a cat-a-log adds to a Pet, held as the bytes of its single-object encoding. Defined in spec/fields.md, section 12.","fields":[{"axt.advanced":true,"axt.emoji":"🔖","axt.help":"The type of this extension.","axt.help_translations":{"de":"Der Typ dieser Erweiterung."},"axt.label":"Extension type","axt.label_translations":{"de":"Erweiterungstyp"},"doc":"The full name of the extension's record type, such as org.example.catalog.CatExtension, which holds its major version, of at most 256 bytes; at most one extension of a name in a list.","name":"name","type":"string"},{"axt.advanced":true,"axt.emoji":"📦","axt.help":"The values of this extension.","axt.help_translations":{"de":"Die Werte dieser Erweiterung."},"axt.label":"Extension data","axt.label_translations":{"de":"Erweiterungsdaten"},"doc":"The extension's record in single-object encoding: the marker C3 01, the fingerprint of its writer schema as 8 bytes in little-endian order, and the record's Avro binary encoding. Passed on unchanged by an app that does not know the type.","name":"data","type":"bytes"}],"name":"Extension","namespace":"axt","type":"record"},"type":"array"}}],"name":"Document","namespace":"axt.example.v1","type